e too young to be watching Alien....&quot;<br /> &quot;how old were you when you saw it miss?&quot;<br /> &quot;Errrrr&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Is it really hypocrisy, or trying to protect one's children for what is seen as a mistake of youth?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-10-27T02:27:22-07:00","id":1524581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1514933-does-anyone-else-find-vtm-to-be-the-most-depressing-gameline?p=1524558#post1524558\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Is it really hypocrisy, or trying to protect one's children for what is seen as a mistake of youth?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well yeah, because here's the thing-i had a great time doing all the stuff I wasn't supposed to. I loved watching horror movies at 13 and created lifelong passion for horror as a genre It'd be an outright lie to say I regretted them and you wouldn't have been protecting me-you may have even discouraged my natural passions.<br /> <br /> To say nothing of my fondness for heavy metal, horror games partying. ....and partaking of narcotics<br /> <br /> This not however to say that our hypocrisies should prevent us from action because 